      "message": "Instead of creating a special macro for this, you can create Kconfig helper symbol and add it to Kconfig.tcpm\n\nEvery TCPC driver should then add a select statement.\n\n\n```\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_HAS_TCPC\n    bool # Prompt text is blank\n    help\n      This helper symbol indicates that the platform has at least on\n      TCPC enabled.\n\n...\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPM_CCGXXF\n    select PLATFORM_EC_HAS_TCPC\n    \nconfig PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPM_ANX7406\n    select PLATFORM_EC_HAS_TCPC\n```",
